                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[From the Siglo XIX, city of
                            <placeName>Mexico</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1868-03-19">March 19, 1868</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <head>Congressional report–Session of March 18.</head>
                <p>The project with reference to foreigners introduced by Mr. Gudiño y Gomez,
                    published in our issue of the 17th, was read the second time.</p>
                <p>Admitted to discussion, it was referred to the committee on foreign
                    relations.</p>
            </div>
